  "body": "Enquiry over $1.399M\r\n\r\nPeace of Mind Guaranteed – Backed by Stanford Insurance 10-Year Building Warranty.\r\n\r\nTitle and CCC have already been issued!\r\n\r\nSet in the heart of Milford, this brand-new freestanding residence presents a rare opportunity to secure refined modern living in one of the North Shore’s most tightly held and prestigious suburbs. \r\n\r\nOffering approximately 160sqm of intelligently designed living, this home combines space, comfort, and functionality with a strong focus on modern family living. Featuring four double bedrooms and 2.5 luxury bathrooms, this property is ideal for families, professionals, or investors seeking quality and location in equal measure.\r\n\r\nThe interiors have been carefully curated with the owner’s thoughtful selection of design details, ensuring a refined balance of style, comfort, and everyday practicality throughout the home.\r\n\r\nThe luxury bathrooms include underfloor heating, delivering year-round comfort, while a separate guest toilet adds practical convenience for busy households.\r\n\r\nAt the centre of the home is a contemporary open-plan kitchen and living area, seamlessly extending to the outdoor space. This effortless indoor–outdoor flow creates the perfect setting for entertaining and relaxed everyday living.\r\n\r\nA double internal-access garage further enhances practicality, providing secure parking and additional storage.\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights\r\n\r\n• Zoned for Westlake Boys’ & Westlake Girls’ High Schools and Milford School\r\n\r\n• Minutes to Milford Shopping Centre, cafés, supermarkets, and essential amenities\r\n\r\n• Close to Castor Bay and Takapuna Beach\r\n\r\n• Easy motorway access for commuting\r\n\r\n• Surrounded by parks, coastal walkways, and premium North Shore lifestyle options\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n• Brand new freestanding home\r\n\r\n• Approx. 160sqm floor area\r\n\r\n• 4 double bedrooms\r\n\r\n• 2.5 luxury bathrooms with underfloor heating\r\n\r\n• Separate WC\r\n\r\n• Double internal-access garage\r\n\r\n• Contemporary open-plan kitchen and living\r\n\r\n• Seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n\r\n• Quality finishes throughout\r\n\r\n• Low-maintenance design\r\n\r\n• Premium Milford location\r\n\r\n• Stanford Insurance-backed 10-Year Building Warranty\r\n\r\nDeadline Sale\r\n\r\nThis property is being sold by Deadline Sale (unless sold prior). Homes of this calibre in Milford are exceptionally rare and tightly held.\r\n\r\nContact me today to arrange a private viewing or request further information",
